{
  "info": {
    "name": "QR Card Dating App API - Simplified Flow",
    "description": "🎯 **Simplified Admin-Approval Flow**: Users register with name/email → Admin gets notifications → Admin approves/rejects → Automatic email notifications sent.\n\n**Key Features:**\n✅ No password authentication required\n✅ Admin-controlled user approval system\n✅ Automatic email notifications\n✅ Complete user journey testing\n✅ Enhanced error handling and validation\n\n**📋 Important Endpoints:**\n• User Registration: `POST /auth/register` (name + email only)\n• Pending Users: `GET /admin/users/pending` (⚠️ NOT /admin/profiles/pending)\n• Approve User: `POST /admin/users/{id}/approve`\n• Reject User: `POST /admin/users/{id}/reject`\n\n**🚀 Quick Start:** Run 'Complete User Journey' folder to test the full flow.\n\n**📅 Last Updated:** October 13, 2025\n**🔧 Version:** 2.1 - Enhanced Simplified Flow",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
